ber":5,"title":"1.3.17","description":null,"creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":19,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:41:41Z","updated_at":"2014-04-29T00:38:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2014-04-29T00:38:58Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2013-10-11T20:47:24Z","updated_at":"2013-10-14T19:23:48Z","closed_at":"2013-10-14T19:23:48Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Created by **James Revillini**, 15th Nov 2010. _(originally [Lighthouse ticket #1289](http://cakephp.lighthouseapp.com/projects/42648/tickets/1289))_:\n\n---\n\nSUMMARY\n\nA standard link to an image created by HtmlHelper::link within a view template will be broken if not using mod_rewrite.\n\nTO REPRODUCE\n1. download cakephp 1.3.6 from repo\n2. deploy to web-ready folder (hereafter referred to as CAKETEST)\n3. delete /CAKETEST/.htaccess, /CAKETEST/app/.htaccess, /CAKETEST/app/webroot/.htaccess.\n4. uncomment line 69 (Configure::write('App.baseUrl', env('SCRIPT_NAME'));) in /CAKETEST/app/config/core.php\n5. create /CAKETEST/app/views/pages/home.ctp with the following code: <?php echo $html->link('cakephp logo', '/img/cake.icon.png'); ?>\n6. open the browser to whatever address CAKETEST is mapped to\n\nEXPECTED\n\nExpected the link to work.  The link should be pointed to http://localhost/CAKETEST/img/cake.icon.png\n\nWHAT HAPPENS\n\nThe link will be pointed to http://localhost/CAKETEST/index.php/img/cake.icon.png and will be broken when clicked.\n\nNOTES\n\nI attached a deployable test app.  Just decompress it to a web-ready folder and go to the home page for the app.\n","closed_by":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https: